  "news": "<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇨🇳 大中华视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.economist.com/china/2026/10/27/kim-jong-uns-curious-visit-to-china\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">金正恩访华，引发外界关注</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Kim Jong Un’s curious visit to China</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">朝鲜领导人金正恩近日对中国进行了“不寻常”的访问，此次行程正值朝核问题复杂敏感之际，外界密切关注中朝关系走向及其对区域稳定的影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">经济学人</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/united-states-canada/article/3372357/alexander-brothers-each-get-30-years-prison-drugging-raping-women\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">亚历山大兄弟因下药强奸妇女被判30年监禁</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Alexander brothers each get 30 years in prison for drugging, raping women</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">亚历山大两兄弟因多次给女性下药并实施性侵犯，被法庭判处30年监禁。此案凸显了针对女性的暴力犯罪问题及其造成的严重社会危害，引起广泛关注。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">南华早报(独立港媒)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.taipeitimes.com/News/front/archives/2026/10/28/2003866734\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">欧洲议会议员称，台湾与欧盟将自主决定双方关系</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Taiwan, EU decide their ties, MEP says</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名欧洲议会议员表示，台湾和欧盟将自主决定彼此之间的关系。此言论暗示了欧盟在对华政策背景下，可能寻求深化与台湾的非官方往来，引发中国大陆的关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">台北时报(台湾)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cv62yg0erp8zo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">姆巴佩为“不当”的毛泽东言论向中国公众道歉</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Mbappé sorry for &#x27;ill-judged&#x27; Mao remark after backlash in China</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">法国足球明星姆巴佩此前关于毛泽东的言论在中国社交媒体上引发争议后，他为此表达了歉意。此次事件反映出公众人物言论在国际文化交流中的敏感性。（中立）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中国报道</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇺🇸 北美视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theatlantic.com/newsletters/2026/10/quiz-ai-odysseus-tech-industry-nyt/689174/?utm_source=feed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">这是一个关于人工智能的问题，还是奥德修斯归来时的疑问？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Which Is It: A Question for AI, or What Odysseus Asked Upon His Return?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">本文探讨了人工智能在发展过程中面临的身份与认知困境，将其与希腊神话中奥德修斯归家后无人认出的情境进行类比，引发了对技术伦理和人类认知的哲学思考。</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">The Atlantic(中偏左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://foreignpolicy.com/2026/10/27/china-ccp-fifth-plenum-xi-jinping-politics-corruption/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">党代会全体会议对习近平为何如此重要</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Why Party Plenums Matter So Much to Xi</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">文章分析了中共中央委员会全体会议（全会）对于中国国家主席习近平的重要性。全会不仅是政策制定的关键场合，更是巩固领导人权力、统一思想和部署未来战略的关键平台，对中国政治走向具有决定性影响。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">外交政策(外交专业)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.axios.com/2026/10/27/cassidy-hutchinson-indictment-jan-6-testimony\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国司法部未能起诉1月6日国会骚乱事件关键证人卡西迪·哈钦森</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">DOJ fails to indict Cassidy Hutchinson, a key Jan. 6 witness</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">曾在美国众议院1月6日委员会作证的前白宫助手卡西迪·哈钦森，在被指控虚假陈述后，美国司法部决定不予起诉。这一决定引起了公众对证人证词可靠性及司法程序公正性的关注。（独立媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Axios(简报风)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.npr.org/2026/10/27/nx-s1-6019352/southwest-flood-damage-estimates-are-hundreds-of-millions-for-new-mexico-alone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国西南部洪灾在新墨西哥州造成数亿美元损失</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Southwest flood damage estimates are hundreds of millions for New Mexico alone</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">近期美国西南部地区遭遇严重洪灾，仅新墨西哥州一地的经济损失预计就高达数亿美元，对当地基础设施、农业和居民生活造成巨大冲击，凸显气候变化背景下防灾减灾的紧迫性。（中立报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">NPR(公共广播,中偏左)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌍 欧洲视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/exit-polls-suggest-no-clear-victor-in-israeli-election\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">以色列大选出口民调显示无明确赢家</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Exit polls suggest no clear victor in Israeli election</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">以色列最新一轮大选的出口民调结果显示，主要政党或联盟均未能获得组阁所需的多数席位，预示着以色列政坛可能面临漫长的联合政府谈判或再次陷入政治僵局。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">欧洲新闻台(泛欧)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6vgj813mlelo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">挪威和芬兰领导人与普京举行罕见通话</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Norway and Finland leaders hold rare call with Putin</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">挪威和芬兰两国领导人日前与俄罗斯总统普京举行了一次不同寻常的通话，此次接触发生在两国寻求加入北约的背景下，引发了国际社会对北欧地区安全局势未来走向的密切关注。（西方主流）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC世界</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://english.elpais.com/international/2026-10-27/flavio-bolsonaro-flees-to-the-united-states-after-election-defeat-to-lula.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">卢拉赢得选举后，弗拉维奥·博索纳罗逃往美国</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Flávio Bolsonaro flees to the United States after election defeat to Lula</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">在巴西总统选举中，卢拉击败现任总统博索纳罗。据报道，博索纳罗的长子弗拉维奥·博索纳罗在选举结果公布后已前往美国，此举引发外界对其政治前途和家族去向的猜测。（独立媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">西班牙El País</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2026/oct/26/us-forces-accused-of-weaponising-somalia-flood-el-nino\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">美国军队被指控“武器化”索马里洪灾，将妇女儿童困在厄尔尼诺路径上</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">US forces accused of ‘weaponising’ Somalia’s floods by trapping women and children in the path of El Niño</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">有报道指控美国军队在索马里的行动中，利用厄尔尼诺现象引发的洪灾，导致妇女和儿童被困，加剧了当地人道危机，引发了对美军行为伦理和人道主义责任的质疑。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">卫报(英国,中左)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-is-the-us-undermining-the-eu-s-diplomatic-blockade/a-79778863?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">缅甸局势：美国是否正在削弱欧盟的外交封锁？</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Myanmar: Is the US undermining the EU&#x27;s diplomatic blockade?</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-item