道，韩国首尔一处贫民区发生严重火灾，消防部门经过近13小时的努力才将其扑灭，此次火灾导致大量房屋受损，凸显了城市贫困社区的消防安全隐患问题。（韩国媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">海峡时报(新加坡)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2026/10/27/companies/nidec-sue-former-executives/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">日本电产公司因会计问题起诉前高管</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Nidec to sue former executives over accounting issues</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">日本知名电机制造商日本电产公司（Nidec）宣布将对其前高管提起诉讼，原因涉及会计问题，此举表明公司对内部治理和财务透明度的重视，可能揭示更多企业管理内幕。（日本媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">日本时报</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🇳🇿 新西兰视角</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.stuff.co.nz/nz-news/361051803/kiwi-dad-told-exs-new-relationship-days-near-fatal-attack-daughters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">新西兰父亲在得知前妻新恋情数天后，对女儿们发起几近致命的袭击</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Kiwi dad told of ex’s new relationship days before near-fatal attack on daughters</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名新西兰男子在得知前妻有了新恋情后，对两名年幼女儿发动了严重袭击，导致她们生命垂危。此案凸显了家庭关系破裂可能引发的极端暴力事件及其对儿童的毁灭性影响。（独立媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Stuff新闻</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://newsroom.co.nz/2026/10/28/goldsmith-overrules-officials-and-offers-commercial-radio-a-cut-price-deal/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">戈德史密斯勋爵推翻官员意见，为商业电台提供折扣优惠</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Goldsmith overrules officials and offers commercial radio a cut price deal</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">英国文化、媒体和体育部国务大臣戈德史密斯勋爵，不顾官员反对，批准向商业广播电台提供一项大幅折扣协议。这一决定引发了对政府决策透明度及利益集团影响力的关注。（英国媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">Newsroom(深度报道)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.rnz.co.nz/news/health/2201661/long-covid-sufferers-being-denied-insurance-over-mental-health-exclusions-lawyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">律师称：新冠长期症状患者因“精神健康”除外条款被拒保</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Long Covid sufferers being denied insurance over &#x27;mental health&#x27; exclusions - lawyer</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">有律师指出，许多患有新冠长期症状的人士在申请保险时，因保险合同中的“精神健康”除外条款而遭到拒绝。这揭示了保险行业对新兴健康问题认知的滞后性及对患者权益的潜在侵害。（国际媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">RNZ(新西兰国家广播)</span></div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom:22px\"><div style=\"background:#455a64;color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.5px\">🌐 中东·非洲·全球南方</div><div style=\"background:#f5f5f5;border:1px solid #cfd8dc;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;padding:4px 0\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckly0xpxp243o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">小博索纳罗因未上交护照，其护照被巴西政府注销</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Flávio Bolsonaro&#x27;s passports cancelled after he fails to surrender them</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">巴西前总统博索纳罗之子弗拉维奥·博索纳罗因未能按要求上交护照，其护照已被巴西当局注销。这一举动可能与正在进行的司法调查有关，凸显了巴西反腐行动的深入及对政界人士的严格审查。（巴西媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC拉丁美洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/27/iran-war-live-pezeshkian-says-middle-east-can-solve-own-issues-without-us?traffic_source=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">伊朗大选候选人佩泽什基安表示中东无需美国干预可自行解决问题</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Iran war live: Pezeshkian says Middle East can solve own issues without US</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">伊朗总统大选候选人佩泽什基安在直播中表示，中东地区有能力在没有美国干预的情况下解决自身问题。这反映了伊朗在地区事务中寻求更大自主权的立场，并可能预示未来与美国关系走向。（伊朗官方）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">半岛电视台(卡塔尔)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cxdd8nq55d74o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">有争议的伊斯兰教士在尼日利亚北部遭枪杀</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Controversial Islamic cleric shot dead in northern Nigeria</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">一名具有争议的伊斯兰教士在尼日利亚北部地区遭到枪杀。此事件可能加剧该地区的宗教紧张局势，并引发对当地安全状况及极端主义活动上升的担忧。当局已展开调查。（非洲媒体）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC非洲</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #cfd8dc\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cw8rz14k1jvxo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:block;color:#455a64;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:3px;line-height:1.4\">埃及法院判记者莉娜·阿塔拉罚款并勒令新闻网站关闭</a><div style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.4\">Egypt court fines journalist Lina Attalah and orders news site&#x27;s closure</div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"color:#777;font-size:12px;flex:1\">埃及一家法院维持对知名记者莉娜·阿塔拉的罚款判决，并命令其独立新闻网站Mada Masr关闭。此举引发了对埃及新闻自由的担忧，Mada Masr此前曾发布多篇批评政府的报道。（批评性报道）</span><span style=\"background:#cfd8dc;color:#455a64;font-size:11px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-weight:600\">BBC中东</span></div></div>\n</div></div>"
